          "observation": "Table 1 rows sum to about 99–100%, and Greek regions show 65–71% in medium skills. It is unclear whether these are shares of all workers or of highly educated workers, and the table does not report LQs."
        }
      ],
      "reasoning": "It is unclear whether medium skill means ISCO 4 and 8 only, or 4–8. If only 4 and 8, the tiers do not cover all occupations, and how armed forces (ISCO 0) and ISCO 5–7 are treated changes every LQ. Table 1 does not state its denominator, so readers cannot reconstruct the LQs or check the text's numbers. The period stated in the data statement differs from the two analysed years. Together, these gaps prevent the results from being reproduced."
